{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/900077-coywolf-conversion","id":900077,"title":"Coywolf conversion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-26T08:44:56-07:00","id":900077,"title":"Coywolf conversion","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www-tc.pbs.org/wnet/nature/files/2014/09/Mezzanine_309.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www-tc.pbs.org/wnet/nature/files/2014/09/Mezzanine_309.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> PBS: Public Broadcasting Service | 500 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www-tc.pbs.org/wnet/nature/files/2014/09/Mezzanine_309.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www-tc.pbs.org/wnet/nature/files/2014/09/Mezzanine_309.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Yep. Taking on the hybrid. So my major problems is.<br /> <br /> 1. Since the coywolf is both coyote and wolf. Would Coyote or Wolf have custody?<br /> 2. Because of Luna's punishment on Coyote. Is it possible for coywolves to gain auspices?<br /> <br /> Currently on making notes on backstory. I know the time frame since the coywolf appeared in eastern Canada in 1919, so geneology isn't a problem and where coyote and wolf Kinfolk intermingled and if any coywolves bred true to become a new shifter. Oh. Notes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/meet-the-coywolf-infographic-a-field-guide-to-the-coywolf-or-eastern-coyote/8663/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/files/2014/01/coywolf-mez.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/meet-the-coywolf-infographic-a-field-guide-to-the-coywolf-or-eastern-coyote/8663/\" target=\"_blank\"> Meet the Coywolf ~ A Field Guide to the Coywolf | Nature | PBS </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/meet-the-coywolf-infographic-a-field-guide-to-the-coywolf-or-eastern-coyote/8663/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.pbs.org/wnet/nature/meet-the-coywolf-infographic-a-field-guide-to-the-coywolf-or-eastern-coyote/8663/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Your field guide to everything you ever wanted to know about the Coywolf, or Eastern Coyote &mdash; from a trip through the Coywolf's modern day habitat to its very recent evolutionary history. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Not my personal notes but the general notes.<br /> <br /> going through Garou and Nuwisha stats so I can figure out the forms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T10:15:46-07:00","id":900163,"title":"","content":"The books generally go with the mother as what perpetuates spiritual bond to a given Fera. The coywolf population is therefore going to be full of both as breeding went in both directions and all.<br /> <br /> So the simple version is some coywolves are Nuwisha kin, and some are Garou kin, and go from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T11:51:46-07:00","id":900229,"title":"","content":"As we begin deeper study of animal genetics, it's looking like the entire red wolf subspecies is coywolf, so I would err on the side of making them all Garou, unless Coyote has specific plans for a pup. And even then, it would be just like him to intervene at an unexpected moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T13:10:35-07:00","id":900287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/900077-coywolf-conversion?p=900229#post900229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As we begin deeper study of animal genetics, it's looking like the entire red wolf subspecies is coywolf, so I would err on the side of making them all Garou, unless Coyote has specific plans for a pup. And even then, it would be just like him to intervene at an unexpected moment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then there is this: <a href=\"http://blogs.scientificamerican.com/guest-blog/the-hearty-ingredients-of-canis-soup/\" target=\"_blank\">http://blogs.scientificamerican.com/...of-canis-soup/</a><br /> <br /> And the silly fact that all purely black wolves have dog ancestry to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T15:57:56-07:00","id":900426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/900077-coywolf-conversion?p=900287#post900287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Then there is this: <a href=\"http://blogs.scientificamerican.com/guest-blog/the-hearty-ingredients-of-canis-soup/\" target=\"_blank\">http://blogs.scientificamerican.com/...of-canis-soup/</a><br /> <br /> And the silly fact that all purely black wolves have dog ancestry to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Shadow Lords seen sweating and lookin