stats<br /> STR 0/1/3/3/1<br /> DEX 0/1/2/3/2<br /> STA 0/2/3/3/3<br /> Manipulation 0/-1/-3/-3/-3<br /> Appearance -/-/0/-/-<br /> Diff 6/7/6/7/6<br /> <br /> Breeds<br /> Homid - Human born, Rural in Canada, Urban in US and some Canadian cities.<br /> Gnosis 1, Starting Homid Gifts<br /> <br /> Metis - Coywolf shifter born, or Garou/Nuwisha born (accidents happen)<br /> Gnosis 3, Starting Metis Gifts, Deformities<br /> <br /> Oriens - Coywolf born, coyote/red wolf born (depending on Kinfolk)<br /> Gnosis 5, Starting Lupus/Latrini Gifts, limited skills and knowledges<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T10:14:08-07:00","id":904244,"title":"","content":"Another thing to wonder; Given how common these guys apparently are (from the article posted above), how much do you think coywolves have affected how garou guard their wolf-kin? There are a lot who come from Eurasia, where there was only intermixing with dogs at most.<br /> <br /> With Striders, and the Egyptian wolf being thought a jackal for years, I think they are pretty cool. As are Red Talons, given they have African Wild Dog AND Dingo members.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T07:46:19-07:00","id":904959,"title":"","content":"Working on it right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T08:50:09-07:00","id":904980,"title":"","content":"Make I a Gaian mockery breed. Or wyld? Make them physically smaller garou with no auspice. Give em relatively high gnosis... And low rage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T19:09:06-07:00","id":905325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/900077-coywolf-conversion?p=900426#post900426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Shadow Lords seen sweating and looking nervous...</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there are more problems than that. Whenever I've read that online, the same articles also mention that black wolves are a North American only thing. Presumably they don't exist in Europe and Asia so Black Furies and Shadow Lords aren't even possible. However, this genetics lore is way out of my bailiwick, so I don't know how true it is. Obviously if it is, I completely ignore it in game because of obvious reasons.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T19:32:14-07:00","id":905334,"title":"","content":"Besides, its not like they're real wolves so you can have fun instead and say that black fur gene in wolves is actually from the human black hair gene. Really mess with things!<br /> <br /> (and by this i mean a black haird homid shifts lupus and suddenly has black fur as a result...then goes out and breeds passing that trait along, not that its a literal human gene in a wolf)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 06-01-2016, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T21:56:30-07:00","id":905403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/900077-coywolf-conversion?p=905334#post905334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Besides, its not like they're real wolves so you can have fun instead and say that black fur gene in wolves is actually from the human black hair gene. Really mess with things!<br /> <br /> (and by this i mean a black haird homid shifts lupus and suddenly has black fur as a result...then goes out and breeds passing that trait along, not that its a literal human gene in a wolf)</div> </div> </div> </div>That's getting back to the style of Pure Breed where your human appearance is dictated by its rating, though. Best to avoid it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T01:13:08-07:00","id":905465,"title":"","content":"I feel it should. If the tribes are supposed to come from a specific &quot;group&quot; part of the mysticism of the pure breed is you look the pinnacle of that tribe. For me that's all of it, not just magic wolf form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":1939,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","user":"Lyrics Of War","date":". 06-02-2016, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T08:03:45-07:00","id":905642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/900077-coywolf-conversion?p=905465#post905465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel it should. If the tribes are supposed to come from a specific &quot;group&quot; part of the mysticism of the pure breed is you look the pinnacle of that tribe. For me that's all of it, not just magic wolf form.</div> </div> </div> </div>The most important heritage of Garou is Garou, not where the human part came from. Large numbers of werewolf ancestors who were all in the same tribe under the same totem gives you Pure Breed; the human part is a coincidence, and doesn't lend a magical connection to what are disproportionately often Europeans with pale skin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T08:21:07-07:00","id":905659,"title":"","content":"Lyrics of War: I'm not sure on the auspices. Since Garou have them and Nuwisha don't. High Gnosis, I went with the base breeds since there wasn't that much change between the two.<br /> <br /> CeltSPZ: They are officially their own species. Canis Oriens. I leave ascetics like black fur up to the players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T11:13:07-07:00","id":905781,"title":"","content":"I would say to leave the auspices out so that at least mechanically they feel different then garou.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T14:56:48-07:00","id":905978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/900077-coywolf-conversion?p=905659#post905659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lyrics of War: I'm not sure on the auspices. Since Garou have them and Nuwisha don't. High Gnosis, I went with the base breeds since there wasn't that much change between the two.<br /> <br /> CeltSPZ: They are officially their own species. <span style=\"color:#008080\"><i>Canis oriens</i></span>. I leave ascetics like black fur up to the players.</div> </div> </div> </div>Species is never capitalized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T15:10:39-07:00","id":905987,"title":"","content":"When I said not real wolves, I was talking about Garou. I was just joking around about garour (via human genes) influencing how wolves look like instead of dogs. It wasn't a comment meant to be taken seriously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user"